@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+pkg_tinyvcdiff
+==============
+
+This test patches the binary file `source.bin` using `delta.bin` and reconstructs `target.bin`.
+
+`delta.bin` has been created with open-vcdiff:
+
+```
+vcdiff delta -interleaved -dictionary source.bin <target.bin >delta.bin
+```
